# .airstack/ holds secrets, staged deploy trees, logs and pulled machine files.
# Never commit it. deploy refuses to run when .airstack/ is not gitignored.
#
# This example keeps one file from .airstack/ in git: the secrets TEMPLATE
# (.airstack/secrets/*.example.jsonc, placeholder values only). The real secrets files
# (_fleet.jsonc, <machine>.jsonc) stay ignored. If you do not want a template in git,
# replace all lines below with the single line: .airstack/
!.airstack/
.airstack/*
!.airstack/secrets/
.airstack/secrets/*
!.airstack/secrets/*.example.jsonc
